50:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: Soldiers! This can't go on. The enemy we don't guard is always one step ahead of us!
51:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: So we go after him. No more mercy. The enemy wants real war, they'll get it!
52:Soldiers: Yes sir!
53:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: Valtaria may have fallen, but not in our hearts!
54:Soldiers: Yes sir!
55:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: I was born here, the daughter of Karion, king of the capital of Artidram, and as the rightful heir to the throne, I intend to avenge Valtaria and all the fallen warriors who stood in its defense.
56:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: So I change my colors to those of Valtaria and from now on I will represent the fallen kingdom!
57:Soldiers: Yes, sir!
58:Malcolm: Not only beautiful, but also powerful.
59:Malcolm: Attila, I place my troops under your command. :5_00132 I am a builder, not a commander.
60:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: Thank you, Malcolm, but I want you not to leave us right now.
61:Malcolm: And I don't intend to. It's just that I... I mean... I'm also joining the Valtarian rebellion. Even though our chances are slim. 
62:[$09F641]Attilia[$ffffff]: I'm glad I'll have such a tactician by my side.
63:Malcolm: Me too...Um... I mean, I'm glad I'll be by your side:5_00156
64:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: Ehh... They're a good match.
65:[$FAE16B]Alan[$ffffff]: Ughh... And it even bothers me:5_00145. See how they're sucking up to each other:5_00157.
66:[$CC00C0]King Drein[$FFFFFF]: They could do it behind our eyes.